@uri = http://localhost:18080

### Access Token
# @name tokenRequest
POST {{uri}}/realms/bookify/protocol/openid-connect/token
Content-Type: application/x-www-form-urlencoded

client_id=bookify-auth-client
&client_secret=3E3yvXaYppoYBF3Ir6DgtEzADKKzSurZ
&grant_type=password
&scope=openid
&username=test@test.com
&password=123

